        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 687BW, Belleview Single Cylinder Handleset </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional arched shape of the Belleview Handleset is the perfect finishing touch to enhance the glamour of any classic decor while the interior trim selections will look great in almost any home. Made by Kwikset, the 687BW Single Cylinder Door Entrance Set is backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. It is easy to install and will fit all standard pre-drilled doors. The classic Belleview Security Series Handleset has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door thicknesses up to 1-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src =\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-Finish-5.jpg?v=1704354507\" width=\"213\" height=\"165\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Single Cylinder Function Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/belleview-dummy-handleset-kwikset-699bw\"><b>Dummy Cylinder Belleview Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Belleview 687BW Two Piece Single Cylinder Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 Pin Cylinder Lock</li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt Throw</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 3</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>All metal mechanics.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Traditional Belleview Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Crossbore: 2-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Crossbore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Crossbore Hole Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Belleview Single Cylinder Handleset",
                "description": "The traditional arched shape of the Belleview Handleset is the perfect finishing touch to enhance the glamour of any classic decor while the interior trim selections will look great in almost any home. Made by Kwikset, the 687BW Single Cylinder Door Entrance Set is backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty. It is easy to install and will fit all standard pre-drilled doors. The classic Belleview Security Series Handleset has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door thicknesses up to 1-3/4 inches.\r\n",
                "keywords": "KWI-687BWBL, kwikset 687BWBL security series handlesets, keyed handlesets, front door locks, front door handlesets, Belleview single cylinder handlesets, oval handlesets, two piece handlesets, traditional door entry sets, Belleview 687BW single cylinder handlesets, kwikset BL balboa wave leversets, KWI-687BW,"
